- get_max_num: No path exists. This function is part of the Django admin framework (`contrib.admin`) for managing inline forms. The observed symptom occurs during sitemap generation (`contrib.sitemaps`), which is a completely separate application. The name similarity with 'max' is coincidental and unrelated to the `max()` built-in function causing the `ValueError`.
